@startuml SQ07_Resgate
!theme plain
title SQ-07 Resgate de Vantagem + Cupom + E-mails
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Aluno
participant "RewardsPage" as UI
participant "RewardsController" as C
participant "RewardsService" as S
participant "EmailService" as E
participant "PrismaService" as P
database PostgreSQL as DB

Aluno -> UI: Resgatar vantagem
UI -> C: POST /rewards/:id/redeem
C -> S: redeem(rewardId, actor)
S -> P: student + reward(+company)
alt saldo insuficiente / vantagem inativa
  S --> C: 400/404
else ok
  S -> S: gera couponCode
  S -> P: $transaction
  P -> DB: decrement student.balance
  P -> DB: INSERT Redemption ATIVO
  P -> DB: INSERT WalletTransaction REDEMPTION
  P -> DB: INSERT Notification
  S -> E: enqueue(email aluno com cupom)
  S -> E: enqueue(email empresa com cupom)
  E -> P: INSERT EmailOutbox (x2)
  S --> C: redemption
end
C --> UI: cupom
UI --> Aluno: código exibido

note right of E
  Ambos os e-mails incluem
  o mesmo código de conferência
end note
@enduml
